WEBVTT

00:32:29.579 --> 00:32:30.958
we switch their partners.

00:32:30.982 --> 00:32:33.718
Sara: You go to a new chair
with a new person watching you

00:32:33.742 --> 00:32:34.913
and a new pair partner,

00:32:34.937 --> 00:32:36.781
and you start on another activity.

00:32:36.805 --> 00:32:39.226
AG: The activity might be
designing screen layouts,

00:32:39.250 --> 00:32:42.123
or brainstorming test cases
for software projects.

00:32:42.147 --> 00:32:45.477
Helen: We do three different
observations by different people.

00:32:45.501 --> 00:32:46.812
And then those three people

00:32:46.836 --> 00:32:49.242
that observed you get together and --

00:32:49.266 --> 00:32:54.821
George: We go through and we judge
all of the potential candidates.

00:32:54.845 --> 00:32:56.057
Helen: And over dinner,

00:32:56.081 --> 00:32:58.989
by using the pictures
of the interviewees, we vote.

00:32:59.013 --> 00:33:01.843
Scott: We vote with either
a thumbs up, or thumbs sideways,